Boundary notes:
  route53-dns-ops = Route 53 IMPLEMENTATION: hosted zones, Alias records, routing policies,
  health checks, Resolver endpoints and rules, DNS Firewall, DNSSEC KMS steps, Traffic Flow,
  ARC DNS controls, Terraform/CloudFormation/CLI.
  dns-network-ops = ARCHITECTURE + DNSSEC DESIGN + CROSS-PLATFORM COMPARISON: resolution flow,
  chain of trust, platform selection, hybrid design patterns. No content duplication: design
  decisions route to dns-network-ops; Route 53-specific implementation stays here.
  aws-networking-audit = VPC layout, Security Groups, Transit Gateway, NACLs. Route 53 Resolver
  endpoint ENI placement and Security Group rules for health checkers are touched here but
  detailed VPC architecture decisions route there.
  aws-cloud-ops = IAM and KMS policy for DNSSEC, CloudWatch alarm setup for health checks and
  DNSSEC monitoring, broader AWS service ops.

